                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The LUSTRE_&lt;/p&gt;
{RO,RW,WO}
&lt;p&gt;_ATTR spelling.txt entries warn that a new sysfs parameter needs a Documentation/man4/ page, but fire on the macro token unconditionally — with CI gating on warnings, a patch adding a parameter fails whether or not the page exists, and additions to the spelling dictionaries trip their own entries. Suppress the warning when a matching man4 page exists and exempt the dictionaries from their own scan.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
